  "bodyHash": "yk74szqkL/s=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f9c\"><strong>心靈之石</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JGOetF8.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 &nbsp;📖</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">心靈之石是以三塊紫水晶和一顆海洋之心合成獲得的物品。它具有以下特性：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">物品需成對使用，玩家可以藉此尋找另一位持有另一塊心靈之石的玩家。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊右鍵，石頭會朝目標玩家方向發射粒子軌跡。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">接近目標玩家時，他們會泛起粉紅色光芒，便於辨識。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用地圖時，另一名玩家的位置也會顯示在地圖上。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果另一位玩家死亡，你的心靈之石會碎裂，直到對方找回自己的石頭才會自動修復。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，你還可以用紫水晶碎片製作愛心形狀的煙火（僅限 Forge 版本）。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">從此不用再按 F3 找朋友啦！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uRE5flchnYU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">心靈之石可分三個感應距離：0–999 格、1,000–9,999 格，以及 10,000 格以上。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">兩人之間的距離越遠，指示方向的粒子就會變小、音調也會變低。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">還想要更多？試試這個酷炫的附加模組：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connection</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JGOetF8.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">製作模組佔用了我大量時間，如果你喜歡我的作品並願意支持我，可以點擊下方連結。支持者將獲得專屬的<strong>地球儀</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你透過使用優惠碼「supplementaries」向 Akliz 購買伺服器，也能獲得相同獎勵。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？看看 Akliz 吧！他們專為模組版 Minecraft 提供頂級伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其社群溫暖友善，支援服務絕佳，伺服器表現也相當出色。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用優惠碼「supplementaries」即可享<strong>八折優惠</strong>，同時也支持了我的創作！</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JGOetF8.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium_ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
